Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was raining that day as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't come because of the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,if I had killed you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have been free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you choose to be pursued?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,did you love me? {start at frame 1278 or snap to start keyframe? Other options don't look so good}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just run away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly escape from this world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and go where no one else is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.33,0:01:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All our men were defeated, we ran out of\Nweapons and lost all means to—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Julia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't follow in Lin's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going, and pass the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone might have gotten here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them that you weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That you were already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vicious
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,killed off the elders, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has lost sense of\Nwhere they want to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like kites with no strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... you were able to meet Julia...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's... rather chilly... today...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need weapons like\Nthat just to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the very end, I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make a bit of a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are a lucky woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back just at the right time,\Nand got involved in just the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Red-Tail won't be mobile for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing pretty well yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting the short end\Nof the stick and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably not coming back,\Nyou know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He might have been\Noffed somewhere already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!\NHe went off to do away with his past!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You made him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My leg was shot, my ship is busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah! He was nothing but trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So what kind of a woman was Julia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A beautiful, dangerous but normal\Nwoman that you can't leave alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a devilish angel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,or maybe an angelic devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Spike now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All organisms...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All beings with life...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,all have their own stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment a new life is born
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a new star is born,\Nand becomes the guardian star.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This star we stand on is\Nsomeone's guardian star as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That red star, that blue star...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When a life ends,\Nthe star falls and disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Running Rock."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me by such a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His star is about to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is stupid. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not fear death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Death is always at your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When you show fear,\Nit will spring at you faster than light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not show fear,\Nit will only gently look over you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Vicious, I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman's passport is\Ninside it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely she cannot escape\Nfrom this planet easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A beast that has lost a place to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nowhere to return to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The food you cook\Ntastes horrible, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, you sure are eating a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunger is the best spice, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know a story\Nthat goes like this? {extra lead-out}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There once was a tiger-striped cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This cat died a million deaths\Nand was reborn a million times {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and was owned by various\Npeople who he didn't care for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat wasn't afraid to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, the cat was a free cat, a stray cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:11:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He met a white female cat, and the two\Ncats spent their days happily together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Years passed, and\Nthe white cat died of old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The tiger-striped cat cried\Na million times, and then died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It never came back to life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good story...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it for the woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I can do for a dead woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me once...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that the past didn't matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's tied to their past!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at these eyes. {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them is a fake,\Nbecause I lost it in an accident. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, I have been seeing the past\Nin one eye and the present in the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I had believed that what I saw\Nwas not all of reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me things like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You never told me\Nanything about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me stuff like that now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was watching a dream\Nthat I would never awaken from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, the dream was all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My... memory came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing good came out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no place for me to return to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the only place\NI could go back to!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.55,0:13:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you're going\Nto just throw your life away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going there to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going there to see if I really am alive.
