Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Vicious? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On the top floor. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please defeat... Vicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you are finally awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before, Spike
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that I am the only one who can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return those words back to you, Vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, we were\Ndestined to end up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Julia passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bad dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang...
